      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that your contribution has fulfilled its purpose is a heavy burden to carry, especially when the intensity of your former life is so profound. It is understandable to feel that the intensity of \"necessity\" is irreplaceable once it's gone. Instead of viewing this as decay, could you explore ways to channel that precision and dedication into mentoring or a quiet form of advocacy? Those activities can offer a deep sense of controlled significance without the life-or-death pressure of the OR.",
